{"id":"rule-function-graph-method","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>这条规则做什么</h2><dl><dt>用来判断什么</dt><dd>题给表达式及图像任务。</dd><dt>判断结果</dt><dd>适用方法及可展开路线。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>同一题可有多种正确方法；尚未展开不算数学错误。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"branches\"><h2>按题目情况选</h2><p>下面几条可以同时满足，满足哪一条就可以走哪一条。</p><article id=\"transform\" class=\"entry\"><h3>由基本图像变换</h3><p>含绝对值的一次式，可由基本图建立点的对应。</p><p class=\"branch-target\"><span>满足时用</span><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-function-graph-transform/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>图像变换法</a></p></article><article id=\"piecewise\" class=\"entry\"><h3>分段作图法</h3><p>含绝对值的多项式，要求画出完整图像。</p><p class=\"branch-target\"><span>满足时用</span><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-absolute-piecewise-graph/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段作图法</a></p></article><article id=\"inequality\" class=\"entry\"><h3>分段图像解不等式法</h3><p>已知绝对值函数，要求解与水平线比较的不等式。</p><p class=\"branch-target\"><span>满足时用</span><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-piecewise-graph-inequality/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段图像解不等式法</a></p></article></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>说明与题例</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 绝对值函数平移选图</h3><p class=\"problem\">判断 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=|x-1|+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 的大致图像。</p><ol><li>由 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=|x|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span> 向右平移 1，再向上平移 1。</li><li><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>↦</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)\\mapsto(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，</span>左侧递减、右侧递增；核对原选项的标注。</li></ol><p class=\"source\">函数的表示法 B09</p></article></section>"}
